<resources><!--
        Opt in to edge-to-edge (Android 15+ / API 35+).
        MAUI defaults to opting OUT (maui_edgetoedge_optout=true), which makes
        Play Console flag: "Edge-to-edge may not display for all users" and
        "Your app uses deprecated APIs or parameters for edge-to-edge".
        See dotnet/maui PR #25517 for the official opt-in pattern.
    --><style name="MainThemeEdgeToEdge" parent="Maui.MainTheme.NoActionBar"><item name="maui_edgetoedge_optout">false</item><!-- Dark system bars matching the app palette. On API 35+ these are
